    {
      "id": "clavicle",
      "name": {
        "en": "Clavicle",
        "zh": "锁骨"
      },
      "group": "skeleton",
      "mesh": "clavicle.l",
      "material": {
        "color": "tissue",
        "tint": "token:bone"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "The collarbone: a strut from breastbone to shoulder.",
        "zh": "锁骨：从胸骨撑到肩部的一根支杆。"
      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "An S-shaped bone you can feel along its whole length under the skin. Its inner end joins the breastbone, its outer end the shoulder blade, so the arm hangs from the trunk on this strut [M1].\n\nThe front of its inner half gives the clavicular part of pectoralis major its start; subclavius sits in a groove on its underside [M1].",
        "zh": "一根 S 形的骨，整条都能隔着皮肤摸到。内侧端连胸骨，外侧端连肩胛骨，手臂就靠这根支杆挂在躯干上 [M1]。\n\n它内侧半的前面是胸大肌锁骨部的起点；锁骨下肌贴在它下面的一条浅沟里 [M1]。"
      },
      "connects": [],
      "bilateral": {
        "axis": "x",
        "mesh": "clavicle.r"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scapula",
      "name": {
        "en": "Scapula",
        "zh": "肩胛骨"
      },
      "group": "skeleton",
      "mesh": "scapula.l",
      "material": {
        "color": "tissue",
        "tint": "token:bone"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "The shoulder blade: it slides and turns on the ribs.",
        "zh": "肩胛骨：贴着肋骨滑动、转动。"
      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "A flat triangular bone on the back of the rib cage, held there by muscles rather than by a joint with the ribs. Its hook-shaped coracoid process points forward under the collarbone: pectoralis minor ends on it [M1].\n\nSerratus anterior runs under the blade to its inner edge and holds that edge against the ribs [M1].",
        "zh": "一块扁平的三角形骨，贴在胸廓背面，靠肌肉而不是靠关节固定在肋骨上。它向前伸出的钩状突起叫喙突，藏在锁骨下方，胸小肌就止在这里 [M1]。\n\n前锯肌从它下面绕过去，止在它的内侧缘，把这条边压在肋骨上 [M1]。"
      },
      "connects": [],
      "short": {
        "en": "Scapula",
        "zh": "肩胛骨"
      },
      "bilateral": {
        "axis": "x",
        "mesh": "scapula.r"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "humerus",
      "name": {
        "en": "Humerus",
        "zh": "肱骨"
      },
      "group": "skeleton",
      "mesh": "humerus.l",
      "material": {
        "color": "tissue",
        "tint": "token:bone"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "The upper-arm bone: pectoralis major pulls on it.",
        "zh": "上臂骨：胸大肌拉的就是它。"
      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "The long bone of the upper arm. Its rounded head sits in the shallow socket of the shoulder blade, which is why the shoulder moves so freely [M2].\n\nAll three parts of pectoralis major end on a ridge just below the head, on the outer lip of the groove that carries the long biceps tendon [M1].",
        "zh": "上臂的长骨。圆圆的肱骨头放在肩胛骨一个很浅的关节窝里，所以肩关节能朝各个方向活动 [M2]。\n\n胸大肌的三个部分都止在肱骨头下方的一条骨嵴上，也就是容纳肱二头肌长头腱那条沟的外侧唇 [M1]。"
      },
      "connects": [],
      "bilateral": {
        "axis": "x",
        "mesh": "humerus.r"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "forearm",
      "name": {
        "en": "Radius and ulna",
        "zh": "桡骨与尺骨"
      },
      "group": "skeleton",
      "mesh": "forearm.l",
      "material": {
        "color": "tissue",
        "tint": "token:bone"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "The two forearm bones, shown to make the arm whole.",
        "zh": "前臂的两根骨，画出来让手臂完整。"
      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "The radius and ulna are drawn as one part here. No chest muscle reaches them, but the elbow bends and straightens in the exercises, and the triceps pulls on the ulna when you press [M2].",
        "zh": "这里把桡骨和尺骨画成一个零件。胸部肌肉都不到这里，但做动作时肘部要屈伸，推起时肱三头肌拉的就是尺骨 [M2]。"
      },
      "connects": [],
      "short": {
        "en": "Radius & ulna",
        "zh": "桡骨与尺骨"
      },
      "bilateral": {
        "axis": "x",
        "mesh": "forearm.r"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "thorax",
      "name": {
        "en": "Sternum, ribs and costal cartilages",
        "zh": "胸骨、肋骨与肋软骨"
      },
      "group": "skeleton",
      "mesh": "thorax",
      "material": {
        "color": "tissue",
        "tint": "token:bone"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "The rib cage: most chest muscles start here.",
        "zh": "胸廓：大多数胸部肌肉从这里起始。"
      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "Twelve pairs of ribs, the breastbone in front and the bars of cartilage that join them. Pectoralis major starts on the breastbone and the upper cartilages, pectoralis minor on the third to fifth ribs, serratus anterior on the upper eight or nine [M1].\n\nThe muscles between the ribs make the cage rise and fall as you breathe [M2].",
        "zh": "十二对肋骨、前面的胸骨，以及把两者连起来的肋软骨。胸大肌起于胸骨和上部肋软骨，胸小肌起于第 3 到第 5 肋，前锯肌起于上 8 或 9 根肋骨 [M1]。\n\n肋骨之间的肌肉让胸廓随呼吸上提、下降 [M2]。"
      },
      "connects": [],
      "short": {
        "en": "Rib cage",
        "zh": "胸廓"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "thoracic-spine",
      "name": {
        "en": "Thoracic vertebrae",
        "zh": "胸椎"
      },
      "group": "skeleton",
      "mesh": "thoracic-spine",
      "material": {
        "color": "tissue",
        "tint": "token:bone"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "The twelve vertebrae the ribs hang from.",
        "zh": "十二节胸椎，肋骨挂在它们上面。"
      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "Each rib joins a thoracic vertebra at the back. No chest muscle attaches here; the spine is drawn so the rib cage reads as a whole and the back view makes sense [M2].",
        "zh": "每根肋骨在背后都连着一节胸椎。胸部肌肉不附着在这里；画出脊柱，是为了让胸廓看起来完整，背面视图也看得明白 [M2]。"
      },
      "connects": []
    },
