      "material": {
        "color": "muscle",
        "tint": "token:ink-3"
      },
      "short": {
        "en": "Biceps · short",
        "zh": "二头肌短头"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "Starts on the coracoid; bends the elbow.",
        "zh": "起于喙突，屈肘。"
      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "The short head of biceps starts on the tip of the coracoid process, right beside pectoralis minor and coracobrachialis, and runs down the front of the arm to the forearm [M2]. It is drawn here as a neighbour: in a fly it helps hold the slightly bent elbow still.",
        "zh": "肱二头肌短头起于喙突尖，紧挨着胸小肌和喙肱肌，沿上臂前面一直到前臂 [M2]。这里把它画作邻近肌肉：做飞鸟时，它帮着把微屈的肘固定住。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coracobrachialis",
      "name": {
        "en": "Coracobrachialis",
        "zh": "喙肱肌"
      },
      "group": "neighbours",
      "mesh": "coracobrachialis.l",
      "bilateral": {
        "axis": "x",
        "mesh": "coracobrachialis.r"
      },
      "material": {
        "color": "muscle",
        "tint": "token:ink-3"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "From coracoid to humerus; helps raise the arm forward.",
        "zh": "从喙突到肱骨，协助手臂向前抬。"
      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "A small muscle from the coracoid process to the middle of the humerus. It helps raise the arm forward and draw it in, the same direction as the clavicular part of pectoralis major [M2].",
        "zh": "一块从喙突到肱骨中段的小肌肉。它协助手臂前举和内收，方向和胸大肌锁骨部一样 [M2]。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "latissimus-dorsi",
      "name": {
        "en": "Latissimus dorsi",
        "zh": "背阔肌"
      },
      "group": "neighbours",
      "mesh": "latissimus-dorsi.l",
      "bilateral": {
        "axis": "x",
        "mesh": "latissimus-dorsi.r"
      },
      "material": {
        "color": "muscle",
        "tint": "token:ink-3"
      },
      "short": {
        "en": "Latissimus",
        "zh": "背阔肌"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "The broad back muscle; forms the back fold of the armpit.",
        "zh": "宽阔的背部肌肉，构成腋窝后壁。"
      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "The widest muscle of the back. It ends on the humerus close to pectoralis major, so the two make the back and front folds of the armpit [M2]. It pulls a raised arm down, like the sternocostal part of pectoralis major; the back topic covers it in full.",
        "zh": "背部最宽的肌肉。它止在肱骨上，离胸大肌止点很近，所以两者分别构成腋窝的后壁和前壁 [M2]。它把举起的手臂往下拉，作用和胸大肌胸肋部相似；背部主题会详细讲它。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "external-oblique",
      "name": {
        "en": "External oblique",
        "zh": "腹外斜肌"
      },
      "group": "neighbours",
      "mesh": "external-oblique.l",
      "bilateral": {
        "axis": "x",
        "mesh": "external-oblique.r"
      },
      "material": {
        "color": "muscle",
        "tint": "token:ink-3"
      },
      "short": {
        "en": "Ext. oblique",
        "zh": "腹外斜肌"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "Side wall of the belly; its sheet gives the abdominal part a start.",
        "zh": "腹壁外侧的肌肉；它的腱膜是胸大肌腹部的起点。"
      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "The outer layer of the side abdominal wall. Its top slips interlock with those of serratus anterior on the lower ribs, and its flat tendon sheet (aponeurosis) gives the abdominal part of pectoralis major its start [M1]. The core topic covers it in full.",
        "zh": "腹壁外侧最外面的一层肌肉。它上端的肌齿和前锯肌的肌齿在下位肋骨上交错，它扁平的腱膜就是胸大肌腹部的起点 [M1]。腰腹主题会详细讲它。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rectus-abdominis",
      "name": {
        "en": "Rectus abdominis",
        "zh": "腹直肌"
      },
      "group": "neighbours",
      "mesh": "rectus-abdominis.l",
      "bilateral": {
        "axis": "x",
        "mesh": "rectus-abdominis.r"
      },
      "material": {
        "color": "muscle",
        "tint": "token:ink-3"
      },
      "short": {
        "en": "Rectus abd.",
        "zh": "腹直肌"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "The strap down the front of the belly.",
        "zh": "腹前正中的一条长带状肌。"
      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "The long strap muscle from the pubic bone to the fifth to seventh costal cartilages, just below pectoralis major [M2]. In a push-up it works to keep the hips from sagging. The core topic covers it in full.",
        "zh": "从耻骨到第 5 至第 7 肋软骨的一条长带状肌，就在胸大肌下方 [M2]。做俯卧撑时，它出力防止髋部下塌。腰腹主题会详细讲它。"
      }
    },
